OL,3,GNEWSAGarage fire destroys home,
OL,4,Aworkshop and cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FCars, a workshop and an adjoining home
OL,7,Fwere completely destroyed after a
OL,8,Fvehicle caught fire days after
OL,9,Freportedly failing its MOT.
OL,11,FFire crews from Essex, Suffolk and
OL,12,FCambridgeshire were deployed to D and K
OL,13,FVehicle Services at Slade Farm, Little
OL,14,FWalden, Essex, at 12:22 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FAt the height of the blaze, there were
OL,17,F10 fire engines, a water bowser, and a
OL,18,Fturntable ladder at the scene. The fire
OL,19,Fwas extinguished by 16:00 and deemed
OL,20,Faccidental.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
