OL,3,GNEWSAGarage fire destroys home,
OL,4,Aworkshop and cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FMechanic Callum Ogborn, one of the
OL,7,Ffirm's four directors, said "the entire
OL,8,Fworkshop" had been lost, as well as his
OL,9,Ffather and stepmother's home, which
OL,10,Fthey had "spent the last 10 years
OL,11,Fpainstakingly building".
